  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-1",
      "transcript": "Some fish physically fuse with their mates.",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 2.65,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.78aa606cbf1a500a2b73c76171168df5f165642b1ded6a13a417fd38c1a9b9e7",
        "sha256": "78aa606cbf1a500a2b73c76171168df5f165642b1ded6a13a417fd38c1a9b9e7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-2",
      "transcript": "In the deep sea, a tiny male searches for a much larger female.",
      "start": 2.8,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.44d3f6b8a949a27e60c1e5fe8abdfc29700e5331d4ceec2f90d497d3970df534",
        "sha256": "44d3f6b8a949a27e60c1e5fe8abdfc29700e5331d4ceec2f90d497d3970df534"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-3",
      "transcript": "This is the triplewart seadevil.",
      "start": 7.333333333333333,
      "duration": 2.475,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.ed3c17a94be0b463c5fe2af4e49ef887ed6bfd281aebe5538990d1caf51fd5eb",
        "sha256": "ed3c17a94be0b463c5fe2af4e49ef887ed6bfd281aebe5538990d1caf51fd5eb"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-4",
      "transcript": "He grips her skin with hooked teeth. In this species, attachment becomes permanent.",
      "start": 9.966666666666667,
      "duration": 5.375,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.2120708ef85bc5a1fefad801090546e0987bc564fbd0eb577e9c3e2be8c43b10",
        "sha256": "2120708ef85bc5a1fefad801090546e0987bc564fbd0eb577e9c3e2be8c43b10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Over time, their tissues join. Blood vessels connect.",
      "start": 15.533333333333333,
      "duration": 3.675,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.e5c36d3c999d370ce3c9462a6f0084abf480cdef5650c0f2f55248a4d38d37ce",
        "sha256": "e5c36d3c999d370ce3c9462a6f0084abf480cdef5650c0f2f55248a4d38d37ce"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-6",
      "transcript": "Her blood supplies his nutrients, while his testes develop to produce sperm.",
      "start": 19.566666666666666,
      "duration": 5.025,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.175d2dd0fd38cc7cc8e3cecbda5c8482d44ed4a97ae0bd193a96e37befb0a382",
        "sha256": "175d2dd0fd38cc7cc8e3cecbda5c8482d44ed4a97ae0bd193a96e37befb0a382"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-7",
      "transcript": "He doesn't disappear into her. He remains an attached male.",
      "start": 24.766666666666666,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.916be629c9da0a69de9ca4db8ce9fa751f8d3a689f6905785a8f585a89d97a3d",
        "sha256": "916be629c9da0a69de9ca4db8ce9fa751f8d3a689f6905785a8f585a89d97a3d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-8",
      "transcript": "How can foreign tissues coexist? These fish have lost key parts of adaptive immunity.",
      "start": 28.666666666666668,
      "duration": 5.65,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.8efb5a85de63576b03dc53ff8cc659de1853c14bc0484254f641c859ce621332",
        "sha256": "8efb5a85de63576b03dc53ff8cc659de1853c14bc0484254f641c859ce621332"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-9",
      "transcript": "Exactly how their remaining defenses work is still being studied.",
      "start": 34.46666666666667,
      "duration": 4.3,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.19e54e0a9c6616c392e049dd824c942cfedb05e2f167ce80319592edf45cf0fd",
        "sha256": "19e54e0a9c6616c392e049dd824c942cfedb05e2f167ce80319592edf45cf0fd"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-10",
      "transcript": "In a world where mates are hard to find, staying together may secure future spawning.",
      "start": 38.9,
      "duration": 5.25,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.acf2fb1911e33760b5a3ba9515a133fcc98e1fc2fcb4a0396c16a9a364e3be80",
        "sha256": "acf2fb1911e33760b5a3ba9515a133fcc98e1fc2fcb4a0396c16a9a364e3be80"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-11",
      "transcript": "Two fish. A lasting connection.",
      "start": 44.36666666666667,
      "duration": 2.525,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.16bc2d5b5055b6985887468fffd67949c99214c0d75edc530e4d326ea1d53461",
        "sha256": "16bc2d5b5055b6985887468fffd67949c99214c0d75edc530e4d326ea1d53461"
